docs/oswa/PRODUCT.md:13:The Obesity Surgery WA website rebuild is a patient acquisition system, not a brochure. It exists to route high-intent Perth patients to the right procedure page, cost information, or booking path — and to give them enough trust signals to take the next step without leaving. Success is a consultation booked, not a page viewed.
