docs/oswa/content-review-2026-07/review/SUMMARY.md-16-All verdicts are about fixable copy, not structure — the writer's structure, tone and empathy are genuinely good, and nothing needs a restart. **Importantly, a chunk of the flagged wording was inherited from our own briefs** (detail below), so this is a joint fix pass across drafts AND briefs, not a critique of the writer.
