docs/oswa/content-review-2026-07/review/SUMMARY.md-36-- Positive: hub vs spokes carve-up is mostly right (no competing H1s); the bypass-vs-sleeve angle is well handled; tone matches the "sceptical of promises, responds to honesty" reader.
