docs/oswa/content-review-2026-07/review/am-i-eligible.md:349:> Draft L208-L221: The cost of weight loss surgery in Perth varies depending on the procedure, your level of private health cover, your hospital excess, and anaesthetist fees. For patients with appropriate private health insurance (typically a gold-tier or equivalent policy) a significant portion of the overall cost is covered, and Medicare rebates apply when eligibility criteria are met. For those without private health cover, or where out-of-pocket costs are a concern, financing options such as Zip and TLC are available, and accessing your superannuation for weight loss surgery may be possible in certain circumstances. Before any commitment is made, our team provides a clear, itemised breakdown of what applies to your situation. Before any commitment is made, our team provides a clear, itemised breakdown of every cost that applies to your situation so there are no surprises.
