docs/oswa/content-review-2026-07/review/bariatric-surgery-perth.md-421-> Surgery is not the only pathway. Some people may discuss medical weight management, dietitian-led support or a staged approach before considering surgery. The clinical team should assess which options are appropriate and explain their limits, follow-up requirements and risks.
