87-### Eligibility
88:- **MBS/BMI note:** For Medicare item 31575, eligibility generally requires a BMI of 40 or above, or BMI 35–39.9 with at least one major obesity-related condition — always subject to individual clinical assessment.
89-- **Bullet points to address:**
90-  1. BMI is a starting point only — the surgeon assesses the whole health picture, not just a number.
