+> Total out-of-pocket costs vary depending on private health cover, surgeon and anaesthetist fees, hospital charges, complexity and any applicable gap. Medicare item 31575 may attract a rebate when MBS requirements are met, while private health insurance may contribute to hospital and theatre costs depending on the policy, waiting periods and fund rules. Current estimates and the components that apply to your circumstances are provided at consultation; ask the team to explain available funding pathways and review the current gastric sleeve cost guide before deciding whether to proceed.
 
 Why it matters: The brief explicitly says not to quote a single dollar figure. Costs, rebates, private-health benefits and funding pathways need current, approved disclosure and should be framed as matters to discuss at consultation.
 
