content-briefs/gastric-sleeve-perth.md:106:4. **Hospital recovery** — At [hospital identity to be verified] (the existing SJOG Murdoch or Subiaco reference is a hospital identity to be verified — open question). Patient starts on fluids and progresses under guidance from nursing and dietetic staff.
content-briefs/gastric-sleeve-perth.md-107-5. **Returning to daily life** — Timing for desk-based, physical or manual work depends on recovery and surgeon advice.
